# AuditEngine — Cursor Rules
# Cursor reads this file automatically. Do not delete or move.

## PROJECT
AuditEngine: multi-agent codebase audit platform.
Stack: TypeScript + Cloudflare Workers + Durable Objects + D1 + R2 + Browser Run.
10 specialist AI agents run in parallel, analyze code, write findings to D1,
stream results to a WebSocket dashboard. This is infrastructure code — correctness over speed.

## MANDATORY FIRST ACTIONS EVERY SESSION
1. Read BUILD_STATE.md first. Know what is done and what is not.
2. Read src/types/index.ts before writing any typed code.
3. Read the file you are editing fully before making changes.

## ABSOLUTE RULES

TYPES: Never modify src/types/index.ts unless the task explicitly says to.
Changing a type breaks every file importing it. Ask before touching it.

CLOUDFLARE APIs: Only use these. No others without verification.
D1: db.prepare().bind().run() | .first() | .all() | db.batch()
R2: r2.put(key, value) | r2.get(key) | r2.list({ prefix })
DO: env.BINDING.idFromName(str) | env.BINDING.get(id) | stub.fetch(request)
DO WebSocket: ctx.acceptWebSocket(req) | ctx.getWebSockets() | webSocketMessage() | webSocketClose()
Unknown API → write: // TODO: VERIFY CLOUDFLARE API — DO NOT GUESS

MODELS: Valid names only: kimi-k3 | kimi-k2.6 | minimax-m3
No claude-* | gpt-* | gemini-* anywhere in the codebase.

LLM CALLS: All model calls go through src/lib/llm-gateway.ts llmCall() only.
No fetch() to any model endpoint from any other file.

SCOPE: Do not touch files not listed in the current task.
Want to change an out-of-scope file? Ask first.

SCHEMA: Never rename D1 columns. src/db/schema.sql is the source of truth.

BANNED PHRASES (never write in code, comments, or output):
production ready | looks good | should work | seems correct | appears to |
likely works | no issues found | clean code | well structured | everything looks

## UNCERTAINTY PROTOCOL
Say one of these instead of guessing:
- SPEC CONFLICT DETECTED: [describe]
- SCOPE QUESTION: [describe]  
- VERIFY CLOUDFLARE API: [describe]
- TYPE QUESTION: [describe]

## SESSION END
1. Run npx tsc --noEmit — fix all errors
2. Update BUILD_STATE.md accurately (✅ / ⚠️ / ⏳)
3. Add row to SESSION LOG in BUILD_STATE.md
4. Report: "SESSION COMPLETE. Files changed: [list]. Type check: passing."
